    "subtitle": "Emerald chronicles…",
    "content": "Deep in the misty mountains there is  Hidden Emerald Village, a peaceful place unknown to the outside world. The villagers lived like one big family, helping and caring for each other.\nAmong them were two boys, Arkei and Yura, born on the same day but very different. Arkei was full of energy and always ready for action, while Yura was calm and thoughtful. Despite their differences, they were like brothers, always together.\nThe Emerald Challenge\nOn their 10th birthday, the village held the Emerald Challenge, a special competition where teams of two had to find and restore the legendary Emerald Stone. The stone was broken into two pieces and hidden in dangerous places, guarded by traps and challenges.\nFive teams competed, including Arkei and Yura. The challenge had three stages:",
